# Custom Suricata Rules for Lab Environment

# 1. Detect hping3 flood attacks (ICMP flood)
alert icmp any any -> any any (msg:"POTENTIAL DOS - hping3 ICMP Flood Detected"; detection_filter:track by_src, count 20, seconds 1; sid:1000001; rev:1;)

# 2. Detect high volumes of unexpected DHCP requests (DHCP Starvation)
alert udp any 68 -> any 67 (msg:"MALICIOUS ACTIVITY - Possible DHCP Starvation Attack"; content:"|01 01 06 00|"; depth:4; status:established; sid:1000002; rev:1;)
